# Environment files for tareitas-web
#
# Committed mode files (pick a script):
#   yarn dev-local   → .env.development  → http://localhost:3000
#   yarn dev-prod    → .env.prodapi      → https://api.tareitas.net
#
# Optional personal overrides (gitignored):
#   cp .env.local.example .env.local
#
# Production build (Hetzner deploy):
#   yarn build  → defaults to https://api.tareitas.net when VITE_API_URL is unset
